    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>A high-output barrel assembly with a heavy-duty kinetic coil stack that maximizes the velocity of each round fired from a pistol platform. The upgrade draws additional power from the weapon's thermal cell to sustain the enhanced field output, but the result is a pistol that hits with the force of a weapon two classes above it. Preferred by infiltrators and agents who need stopping power without the bulk of a rifle. Designed for pistols. Grants a +2 item bonus to weapon damage rolls.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install on weapon during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure. Requires a pistol.</p>"
